WEBVTT

00:00.000 --> 00:01.480
[Tank cannon cracks over the engine]

00:01.500 --> 00:04.580
[Armoured engines and tracks rumble]

00:04.600 --> 00:07.480
[Gunfire along the trench line]

00:07.500 --> 00:08.980
[Distant fire as the mortar crew gathers]

00:09.000 --> 00:11.547
[Mortar rounds burst in succession]

00:11.567 --> 00:14.080
[Boat engines as the squad goes ashore]

00:14.100 --> 00:17.547
[Cannon fire and splashes off the patrol ship]

00:17.567 --> 00:20.580
[Jet engines sweep over the harbour]

00:20.600 --> 00:22.613
[Bombs hit the water in a line]

00:22.633 --> 00:25.480
[A final barrage echoes across town]
